% 15-SYS: SYSTEM SERVICE WORDS AND DICTIONARY TOOLS (RDEF GETTIM ...
% INVENTORY).  ONLY THINGS THAT DO NOT CHANGE FROM RUN TO RUN ARE PRINTED.
DECIMAL
30 'TS SVARIABLE
"ASCTIM  " MSG GETTIM TS ASCTIM TS COUNT = DROP CR
"REVISION " MSG REVISION CR
80 'LN SVARIABLE
"TRNLOG  " MSG "SYS$LOGIN" LN TRNLOG LN MSG CR
% JPI$_PID IS 319 HEX.  DESPITE ITS COMMENT GETJPI LEAVES ONLY THE VALUE
% (SYSERR TAKES THE CODE), AND ITS BUFFER IS ONE LONGWORD.  THE PID
% VARIES, SO ONLY ITS SIGN IS PRINTED.
"GETJPI  " MSG 793 GETJPI GTZ = CR
"WHERE   " MSG 'DUP WHERE CR
"WHERE ? " MSG 'NOSUCH WHERE CR
'T15 : 1 2 + ;
"WHAT    " MSG () T15 4+ WHAT CR
